<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

<p>Hurmatli $USER.getName(),</p>

<p>$CREATOR_NAME  quyidagi hodisani $SHARED_DATE da siz bilan ulashganligi haqida maʼlum qilamiz:</b></p>

<p><b>Hodisa tafsilotlari:</b></p>

<div style="background-color:lightblue; width:100%;">
    <p>Sarlavha: $EVENT_NAME</p>

    <p>Tavsif: $DESCRIPTION</p>

    <p>Qachon: $DATE</p>
</div>

<p>Qayerda: $WHERE</p>

<table>
    <tr>
        <td style='vertical-align:top;'>Kim bilan ulashildi:</td>
        <td> $SHARED_EMPLOYEES</td>
    </tr>
</table>

    $GUESTS

<p>Hodisa tafsilotlarini taqvimda koʻrish uchun <a href="$LINK">bu yerga</a> cherting.<br/>
    * Agar havolani cherta olmasangiz, quyidagi manzildan nusxa olishingiz va uni veb-brauzeringizga joylashtirishingiz mumkin:
    <span style="color: #0033FF">$LINK</span></p>

</body>
</html>